WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.636
For bigger jobs, hand over a whole mission. Describe the outcome, and LATYS plans the steps, assigns the agents, and checks their work.

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:15.804
Let it loop until every check passes. Or queue it for the night shift, and wake up to a briefing.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:22.474
Want a second opinion? Ask the Council. Several models take on the same question, and you get one clear verdict.
